.env no name: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: expected NAME=value with a name of letters, digits and underscores
.env bad name: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: expected NAME=value with a name of letters, digits and underscores
.env no equals: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: missing '='
.env unterminated single: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: unterminated single quote
.env unterminated double: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: unterminated double quote
.env after the quote: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: text after the closing quote
.env unknown escape: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: unknown escape in double quotes
.env quote inside: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:2: GOLDEN_API_KEY: a quote inside an unquoted value
.env assigned twice: secret/bad-env-file: case.env:3: GOLDEN_API_KEY: assigned twice
